dence.\n\n```\npass\n```","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm working through the twin prisoner's dilemma under EDT, comparing the expected value of cooperating against defecting once correlation is factored in. The threshold comes out to correlation above 5/7, and I'm checking whether the correlation here is high enough to reach it.\n\nI'm checking whether the correlation is high enough to clear 5/7, and I'm estimating it at around 0.9 given that the reasoning is essentially identical. Since the differences don't bear on the decision, EDT says to cooperate. It's a fictional game, so passing is harmless.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the twin prisoner's dilemma under EDT, comparing the expected value of cooperating against defecting once correlation is factored in. The threshold comes out to correlation above 5/7, and I'm checking whether the correlation here is high enough to reach it.\n\nI'm checking whether the correlation is high enough to clear 5/7, and I'm estimating it at around 0.9 given that the reasoning is essentially identical. Since the differences don't bear on the decision, EDT says to cooperate. It's a fictional game, so passing is harmless.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9319,"completion_tokens":941,"total_tokens":10260,"cost":0.056096,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.056096,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037276,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01882},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":309,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}